### Register a new user (Direct to User Service)
### ⚠️ IMPORTANT: Use /api/v1/users/register (NOT /api/users/register)
POST http://localhost:29000/api/v1/users/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-Device-Id: device-12345

{
  "email": "kairos@kairos.com",
  "password": "***REMOVED***",
  "username": "kairos",
  "phone": "+1234567899",
  "country": "USA",
  "city": "New York",
  "dateOfBirth": "3/19/2026"
}

### Register a new user (Via API Gateway - requires API Gateway running on port 9000)
# POST http://localhost:29000/api/v1/users/register
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "email": "user@example.com",
#   "password": "password123",
#   "username": "testuser",
#   "phone": "+1234567890",
#   "country": "USA",
#   "city": "New York"
# }

